%% The two-pass audit handshake of one handoff.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Parked: first envelope
    Parked --> Challenged: audit challenge sent
    Challenged --> Parked: commit changed
    Challenged --> GateCheck: same commit
    GateCheck --> Released: gates pass
    GateCheck --> Challenged: gate fails (bounce)
    Parked --> Held: rounds or bounces exhausted
    GateCheck --> Held: bounces exhausted
    Held --> Released: operator accepts
    Released --> [*]
